Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.86,0:00:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.32,0:00:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.18,0:01:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.30,0:01:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.16,0:01:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, at daybreak, the pirates will be\Nlanding at this shore to begin their attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the only way they'll be able to get\Nto the village is to go up this slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of the shoreline is sheer\Ncliffs, so they have to come through here.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.10,0:02:07.07,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(734,734)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(692,734,\1a&H00&)\t(2236,2277,\1a&HFF&)}The Slope
Dialogue: 2,0:02:04.10,0:02:07.07,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(734,734)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Slope
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can fight them while they're\Nfunneled into that narrow pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their numbers won't mean anything\Nand the village will be protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, sounds pretty easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.74,0:02:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talking about it is, but\Nvictory depends on our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.54,0:02:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it you guys can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cut. I stretch! I steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trying to get in a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make it up funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Klahadore, welcome back. How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's resting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was quite exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leave town for a few hours\Nto tend to some errands,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and everything falls to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Usopp certainly knows how\Nto cause trouble, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and on top of everything else he's\Ndone today, He claimed you were a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't think of a more outrageous lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.62,0:03:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a present, of course,\Nfrom Miss Kaya to you, Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.24,0:03:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been three years since\Nyou came to this mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and this gift is to say\Nthank you for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a commemoration of sorts. How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The glasses you're wearing are always\Nslipping and you have to push them back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the lady of the house custom\Nordered a new pair for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't she just the most thoughtful\Nyoung woman you've ever met?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How appropriate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow will be a day\Nworth commemorating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a crescent moon tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on nights like these\Nthat I truly feel alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.42,0:03:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart races and my\Nblood boils in my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alto, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:04:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you do such a\Nthing to Miss Kaya's present?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll be receiving a gift, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it won't be glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be her entire estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose there's no reason to\Ncarry on the act any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a few hours, the village will\Nbe mourning the unforeseen tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three long years I've\Nquietly waited for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.21,0:04:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Django!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Django, it's almost daybreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:04:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only the sun can wake me up\Nand live to tell about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in a really bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mornings are the worst. Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moon is still up, so the\Nsun couldn't have woken me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, which one of you did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.20,0:05:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No apologies, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're very sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was mad just a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.04,0:05:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in a better mood now, and that's all\Nthat matters, so keep your big trap shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention, men.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.98,0:05:35.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(483,435)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(441,483,\1a&H00&)\t(2485,2527,\1a&HFF&)}"One-Two" Jango\NActing Captain of the Black Cat Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.98,0:05:35.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(483,435)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\3c&HFAFAFB&\c&HFAFAFB&\1a&HFF&\t(441,483,\1a&H00&)\t(2485,2527,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}"One-Two" Jango\NActing Captain of the Black Cat Pirates
Dialogue: 3,0:05:32.98,0:05:35.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(483,435)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}"One-Two" Jango\NActing Captain of the Black Cat Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they'll be able\Nto make it up this slope now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this oil we put here should keep them\Noccupied while we go to work on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going to be busy slipping and\Nsliding around like a bunch of idiots,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we show up and beat\Nthe crap out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:05:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, so that's your plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to defend the village\Nno matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope none of us slip on that\Noil and end up down there with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because that would be like\Nsliding into a meat grinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lusop, I gotta hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pretty good at fighting dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't anyone alive\Nwho can best me with a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slingshot or beat me at\Nthe art of fighting dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ashore, crash the village,\Nhead for the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, there are already\Ntwo boats here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:06:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I investigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave them for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't look like treasure ships to\Nme, and we have a schedule to keep...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.98,0:07:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were gonna fight. The\NSun's up. What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.06,0:07:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe they overslept
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, maybe I'm hearing things,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it sounds like battle\Ncries from somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I definitely hear them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.96,0:07:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be, what can't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a shore just\Nlike this to the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They went...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're at the wrong shore? That's not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is where they had their\Nsecret meeting, so I just assumed, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before they make it to\Nthe village, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to head directly north from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you run, you can make\Nit in three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.78,0:07:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The terrain there is\Nalmost exactly the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:08:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so all we need to do is\Nstop them at the slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If those filthy pirates are at the North\NShore, then they've already seen our boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll take our treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there in 20 seconds! Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brilliant oil strategy\Nwas all for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.20,0:08:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My precious treasure! Hey! Huh? What are\Nyou doing? Let's get out of here! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.05,0:08:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go, you moron! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you understand\Nthe treasure's in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.72,0:08:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That girl's gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear on my life they'll\Nnever set foot in my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Luffy sure has a good runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so far ahead I can't\Neven see him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those mongrels are in big trouble if\Nthey so much as look at my treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an ambush!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the legendary Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't supposed to\Nbe the first one here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was running way ahead of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't handle these guys alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.26,0:09:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to get past this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The village!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said run north, and I ran in a coldish\Ndirection, so I should be at the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one of the troublesome\Nbrats who overheard our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.44,0:10:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave here while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't, my 100 million\Ncrewmen will massacre all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.12,0:10:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we really supposed to believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.79,0:10:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.71,0:10:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, he's obviously lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's time to call his bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They saw through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy seriously thought he\Ncould fool us. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been lying to us this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Jango, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, is it bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.10,0:10:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We searched those other ships and\Nfound a huge load of treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.10,0:10:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to say how much, but I\Nbet it's around 5 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:10:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world did those guys\Nget a hold of so much treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.44,0:11:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you found my loot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just going to let\Nus take your treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just turn around and forget all about\Nthis place, and the treasure is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think people that\Nstupid actually existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, he's just\Nembarrassing himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.34,0:11:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, do you know what a pirate is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to take this treasure, and\Nthere's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there is no way we're turning\Nback until we get where we came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the count of one, two,\NJango, you'll let us by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that weapon from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you ever try to get\Nmy heart and treasure away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who is this crazy girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the time to\Nbe hypnotizing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a mission to carry out, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That treasure boat is mine, and I'm not\Ngoing to let you have a single bearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.39,0:12:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, you better clear out, because\NI'm coming down there to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That really hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said you could give them my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got what you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't give them the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just said I would give it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the same thing, and\NI just saved your life. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I forgot to mention it to you\Nearlier Don't ever watch his ring routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That weirdo's a hypnotist
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hypnotist, so where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a fast runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.94,0:12:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he'd be here way\Nahead of you I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.32,0:12:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,either got lost or he chickened\Nout at the last minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing that could keep\Nhim from a fight is getting lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right when we need him to go\Nahead and take command here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time you\Ngo and kick their butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.49,0:12:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take on a boatload\Nof vicious pirates by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:12:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, like I'm going to do any fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beneath this calm exterior lies\Nthe abject terror of a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.04,0:13:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you think you're scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm so scared I am\Nliterally about to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, your eyes are completely dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liars can smell their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.56,0:13:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just your upper lip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.16,0:13:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got beat up my...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.22,0:13:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.40,0:13:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, men, let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crush them and move to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have some Caltrops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are just what the doctor ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna love this. Caltrop! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, if you're still alive when I get\Nout of here, I'm going to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.06,0:14:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, how do I get to the\Nnorth shore from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.96,0:14:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way is north?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.80,0:14:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, here comes the lead star!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.44,0:14:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, you're quite\Nthe warrior after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you got this handled,\Nso I'll just take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you haven't done anything yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.90,0:14:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are caltrops behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.15,0:14:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dropped those things behind us, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:14:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you really thought you\Nwere going to stop us down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.24,0:15:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro hates waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, you jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let you step foot in that village!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.42,0:15:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was lie like I always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, today will be like every other\Nday in that sleepy little town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause you and your cronies\Nwill never set foot in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid girl
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.58,0:16:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, I won't tell you again
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've wasted enough time playing\Npirates. Quit bothering with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and move to the village Or have\Nyou forgotten that this is Captain
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuro's operation And he doesn't\Nlook favorably on his well-laid
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plans being ruined by idiots He'll kill us\Nall Do you understand that, you cretins?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's get to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.60,0:16:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't take another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave this village alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't deserve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:16:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.60,0:17:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this captain jungle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody told us the killers like those.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.24,0:17:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be here about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the best those\Npirates can dish out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was hoping for a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you— After leaving me down there,\Nyou're lucky I'm not kicking your butt. Too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never told me which.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,direction was north.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.56,0:17:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't appreciate tardiness, not one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:18:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They know full well what happens to those\Nwho are foolish enough to upset my plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they think they can take their\Nsweet time well if they have
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgotten the consequences of\Ndisappointing me, I'll kill them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are really that strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you have been slower?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who pushed me down\Nthat oil slick so you could get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I slipped, you fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.70,0:18:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least one of us made it out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's better than both of\Nus being stuck at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should have just been you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run straight north, he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.14,0:18:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.14,0:18:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, how am I supposed to know\Nwhich way north even is out here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who ran away so sure\Nof yourself, ready to take on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got so excited, I\Nstarted running, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun rises high in the sky now, and that\Nmeans Captain Kuro goes very impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men, don't just lie there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't tell me you're\Ngoing to let them win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just a couple of idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact is, we don't have time to\Nlollygag around here any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If our enemy is strong, then we\Nmust become stronger than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, stare deeply into this ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I will count one,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.72,0:19:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two, Jango, and after that, you\Nwill all begin to grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wounds will heal and\Nyou will grow stronger still.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.10,0:19:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like hypnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.24,0:19:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to convince them\Nthey're stronger than they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, that'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yee-yee-yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.14,0:20:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one guy completely\Ndestroyed the cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always thought hypnotizing\Npeople was a bunch of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was just one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine what the whole crew can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.86,0:20:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go, and strike down\Nall who stand in your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.08,0:20:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, you might want to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you and I will take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.30,0:20:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you let that\Nfreak hypnotize you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he really is a simple-minded idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Captain Kuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made one hell of a miscalculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are not your average village idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tear it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.58,0:22:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to destroy our ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.30,0:22:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna crush us with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.34,0:22:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.25,0:22:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, jungle, you will fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.18,0:22:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.46,0:23:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like those guys are probably\Ndown for the count, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.30,0:23:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.50,0:23:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.54,0:23:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Luffy's still trapped\Nunderneath that cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.82,0:23:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.26,0:23:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should really worry about your\Nown injuries by the looks of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.66,0:23:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.12,0:23:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now our whole plan's shot to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do with this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.44,0:23:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Kuro sees this and he'll kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.90,0:23:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Page come check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.54,0:24:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's some bad stuff going down?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.32,0:24:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot we still have our trump card.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.04,0:24:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.22,0:24:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miyaban brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.84,0:24:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the butler from Kaya's\Nmansion, but it's so early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.34,0:24:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he walking to the shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.70,0:24:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or someone could beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.66,0:24:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The promised land was in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.74,0:24:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.52,0:25:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.14,0:25:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.54,0:25:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.54,0:25:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing\Nit until it comes true!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.52,0:25:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.12,0:25:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.90,0:25:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My memories won't fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.44,0:25:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?

